    "brightspace-contact": "<div id=\"contact-section\" role=\"contentinfo\">\n    <h2>Contact Us</h2>\n    <p>Need help? Reach out to the Office of Educational Technology!</p>\n    <p>Email: <a href=\"mailto:BrightspaceSupport@southflorida.edu\">BrightspaceSupport@southflorida.edu</a></p>\n    <p>Phone: <a href=\"tel:863-784-7016\">863-784-7016</a></p>\n</div>",
    "brightspace-instructor": "<section aria-labelledby=\"instructor-tutorials\">\n    <h2 id=\"instructor-tutorials\">Instructor Tutorials</h2>\n    <p>Brightspace Instructor Tutorials are located in the Brightspace Resources for SFSC Instructors Course in Brightspace.</p>\n    <ul>\n        <li><a href=\"https://www.southflorida.edu/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/Brightspace-Instructor-Calendar-2026.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Calendar</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://www.southflorida.edu/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Brightspace-Instructor-Content-2026.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Content</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://www.southflorida.edu/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Brightspace-Instructor-Discussions-2026.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Discussions</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://www.southflorida.edu/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Brightspace-Instructor-Dropbox-and-Turnitin-2026.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Dropbox</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://www.southflorida.edu/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/Brightspace-Instructor-Grades-1-Set-up-2026.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Grades – Part 1</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://www.southflorida.edu/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/Brightspace-Instructor-Grades-2-Weighted-2026.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Grades – Part 2</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://www.southflorida.edu/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/Brightspace-Instructor-Grades-3-Points-2026.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Grades – Part 3</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://www.southflorida.edu/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Brightspace-Instructor-Quizzing-2026.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Quizzing</a></li>\n    </ul>\n</section>",
    "brightspace-intro": "<div class=\"intro-section\">\n    <p>These tutorials introduce you to Brightspace, SFSC’s online course management system. Select the links below to launch the tutorials. If you have any questions, please contact the Office of Educational Technology at 863-784-7016 or email <a href=\"mailto:BrightspaceSupport@southflorida.edu\">Brightspace Support</a>.</p>\n    <a class=\"contact-btn\" href=\"mailto:BrightspaceSupport@southflorida.edu\">Support</a>\n</div>",
    "brightspace-student": "<section aria-labelledby=\"student-tutorials\">\n    <h2 id=\"student-tutorials\">Student Tutorials</h2>\n    <p>Brightspace Student Tutorial videos are located in the Resources for Current Students Course in Brightspace.</p>\n    <ul>\n        <li><a href=\"https://www.southflorida.edu/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Brightspace-Student-Navigation-2026.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Overview</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://www.southflorida.edu/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/Brightspace-Student-Content-2026.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Content</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://www.southflorida.edu/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Brightspace-Student-Discussions-2026.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Discussions</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://www.southflorida.edu/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Brightspace-Student-Dropbox-2026.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Dropbox</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://www.southflorida.edu/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/Brightspace-Student-Email-2025.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Email</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://www.southflorida.edu/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Brightspace-Student-Grades-and-Feedback-2025.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Grades</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://www.southflorida.edu/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Brightspace-Student-Notifications-2026.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Notifications</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://www.southflorida.edu/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Brightspace-Student-IM-2025.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Instant Messages</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"https://www.southflorida.edu/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Brightspace-Student-Quizzes-2026.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Quizzes</a></li>\n    </ul>\n</section>"
